        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***2 BEDROOM & 2 BATHROOMS CORNER APARTMENT / FOURTH FLOOR / PRIVATE SECURE CAR PARKING CONVENIENTLY CLOSE TO YOUR LIFT / WEST FACING BALCONY / SECURE GATED WELL REGARDED DEVELOPMENT / CONVENIENT LOCATION / EXCELLENT TRANSPORT LINKS***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to present, Apartment 78 Richmond Hall, Drumcondra, Dublin 3. We are truly delighted to offer this large two bedroom corner apartment, beautifully situated on the fourth floor of a highly sought after development.\r\n\r\nAs you step inside this warm and welcoming light-filled apartment, you'll be greeted by an inviting entrance hallway complete with a convenient storage hot press and closet for your laundry. The open plan living and kitchen/dining room is flooded with natural light and features laminate flooring, seamlessly extending to a spacious balcony.\r\n\r\nThe generously sized kitchen is equipped with an impressive array of wall and floor units, topped with sleek countertops, a stylish upstand, and complemented by a tiled backsplash and floor. The master double bedroom is a great size and comes complete with fitted wardrobes and a beautifully tiled en-suite fitted with a shower enclosure. The second double bedroom also offers ample space with fitted wardrobes offering ample storage space.\r\n\r\nCompleting the accommodation is a fully tiled bathroom featuring a relaxing bath with an over-bath shower, basin, and W.C., making it perfect for unwinding after a long day.\r\n\r\nRichmond Hall is nestled in a mature gated development on Richmond Road, mere moments from the charming Fairview Village. The location is unbeatable, with easy access to Clontarf DART station, East Point Business Park, and IFSC, alongside an array of primary and secondary schools, and a variety of shops, bars, and eateries.\r\n\r\nTo truly appreciate the exceptional qualities of this superb property, we highly recommend scheduling a viewing. Please contact KELLY BRADSHAW DALTON at 01-8040500 to arrange your visit today!"
      },
